    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tone is a short puzzle game based on color and sound: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up colors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match the blocks with the background to make them disappear.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek the door.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the lost.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At present, Tone comes with over 10 maps (excluding tutorial maps).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning:\u00a0This game contains flashing lights and imagery.\u00a0 Discretion is advised for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Due to the fine-grained color matching used in this game, we regrettably do not recommend this game for colorblind individuals.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tone is a short puzzle game based on color and sound: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up colors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match the blocks with the background to make them disappear.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek the door.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the lost.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At present, Tone comes with over 10 maps (excluding tutorial maps).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning:\u00a0This game contains flashing lights and imagery.\u00a0 Discretion is advised for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Due to the fine-grained color matching used in this game, we regrettably do not recommend this game for colorblind individuals.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
